From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emir Beganovic <beganovic.emir@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:41:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] firmware: qcom: scm: Allow QSEECOM on ASUS Zenbook 14
 UX3480QA

Allow the use of QSEECOM on the ASUS Zenbook 14 UX3480QA (Snapdragon X
X1-26-100), giving access to the UEFI variables, so that the boot
entries can be read and written from Linux, and to the RTC offset
stored there.

Signed-off-by: Emir Beganovic <beganovic.emir@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
index 3eaa4c9..56aa20e 100644
--- a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
+++ b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
@@ -2302,6 +2302,7 @@ EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(qcom_scm_qseecom_app_send);
 static const struct of_device_id qcom_scm_qseecom_allowlist[] __maybe_unused = {
 	{ .compatible = "asus,vivobook-s15" },
 	{ .compatible = "asus,vivobook-s15-x1p4" },
+	{ .compatible = "asus,zenbook-14-ux3480qa" },
 	{ .compatible = "asus,zenbook-a14-ux3407qa" },
 	{ .compatible = "asus,zenbook-a14-ux3407ra" },
 	{ .compatible = "asus,zenbook-a16-ux3607oa" },
